{"server":"cn","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_10_beg","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_10","title":"“狼之主”","storyCode":"IS-10","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_10_beg.txt","sourceHash":"1487de8faa84fb7226920e4a03d5e059a5c71aca0f7fe249de3e1c05003a4be3","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"德克萨斯曾经对这一切弃之不顾，而她现在选择站在这片土地上。叙拉古再无拉普兰德的容身之所，而她也不需要。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmencommand"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"侦察完毕，没有敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们提供的路线图还真厉害啊，我们居然一路上没怎么遇到阻碍，就最先抵达了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新城区的设计，使用的都是来自哥伦比亚的技术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其中有许多家族成员们完全不曾了解的功能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如说，在我们通过之后，直接通往这座指挥塔的道路如今被封锁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他的一些路口也或多或少被他们用一些技术手段封锁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加上，我们在路上也看到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家族之间的斗争已经逐渐蔓延开了，恐怕，大部分家族即使想要对指挥塔动手，也会被其他家族绊住吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，他们根本想不到，指挥塔已经被我们占领了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。但是，还不到放心的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论是贝洛内，罗塞蒂，还是萨卢佐，至少这三个家族，绝不会放弃这个次级核心区，他们一定会来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有我和德克萨斯在，安心啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我本意并不想把你们也卷进来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是自愿的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是自愿的！作为报酬，你可以之后告诉我，哪里的披萨比较好吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚才说，这些技术来自哥伦比亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，罗塞蒂家族提供了不少支持，所以，我确实也有些担心他们会有突破的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......告诉我，如果他们有必经之路，会是哪里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g1_srcstreet"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对劲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也感觉到了吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然其他家族的阻碍也是一部分原因......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，如果说刚才那道大门，可能是因为某些意外而被启动了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么我们绕路绕到现在，我基本可以确定，这些封锁，绝对是故意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是说，有人先我们一步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，他们很了解这个区域的构造。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......而了解这些的，应该是我们罗塞蒂的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，参与了这个次级核心区改造的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......先不论究竟是谁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道该如何突破？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我可以试试，我手下应该有人知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太浪费时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这真的是有人刻意而为之，那一定会为此上保险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你想说什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我们的合作也谈不上愉快，不过，看起来也就到此为止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝洛内的，某种意义上，我们也算是同病相怜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别把我和你相提并论。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看得出来，你也是那种看起来很聪明，实际上忠心得要命的蠢货。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别给自己脸上贴金了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是在为自己辩解，我知道自己在做什么，我不后悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你呢，如果真的如你所说，你的首领是这一切的始作俑者，而你的兄弟，或许也要站在你的对立面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的下得了手吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的会得到你想要的东西吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，你得到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，我问心有愧，却别无他法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmencommand"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法庭护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阁下，我发现这座指挥塔的技术人员都躲在一间屋子里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法庭护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们想要和你聊聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的技术人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......法官阁下？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别紧张，我不会伤害你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我既不代表某一个家族，也不代表西西里夫人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的技术人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你代表什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的我不代表任何东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的技术人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的技术人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你不伤害我们，我可以帮你们一些忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想问你一个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的技术人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁让你们启动了次级核心区的分离程序，是贝洛内家族的人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的技术人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他说自己是贝洛内家族的领袖，贝纳尔多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝纳尔多......真的是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了所谓的权力，你真的要做到这个地步——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的技术人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他还问我，有没有想象过，一个没有家族的叙拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g1_srcstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面就是能操控那道大门的中枢，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞蒂家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人生何处不相逢啊，切利尼娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实，我们之间，也只有你死我活。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......拉维妮娅，那个法官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卢佐家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卢佐家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们按照您的指示，没有急着突破，而是绕了一些路，抓到了一个官员。这是从他的口中审出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卢佐家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她已经带着自己的手下占领了指挥塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诚然，没有家族会想到，一个小法官居然在一些官员的帮助下，能够做到这样的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，就算她用这样的小把戏拖住了那些家族，她又能做到什么呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卢佐家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首领，大事不好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卢佐家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普兰德，拉普兰德刚才忽然回到家族，毫无征兆地开始攻击家族里的人，正在向您这里靠近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拦住她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卢佐家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普兰德，你的杀人技术，长进了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放在以往，你走到这里，还要再花一些时间，并且多受一点伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你倒是老样子，眼看着自己的手下被杀，却还能无动于衷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能力不足的手下，有什么值得惋惜的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能力不足的孩子呢？哦，瞧我，都忘了，对您来说，孩子和手下，没有分别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道，乖女儿，我最讨厌的，是能力不足却听话的蠢货。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我等了你很久，从你回到这个家里就在等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等着你向我露出獠牙的那一刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，这一刻终于来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我，我的女儿，这么多年以来，究竟是什么，让你一而再，再而三地惹怒我，忤逆我，反抗我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说出来，这样我才可以管教你。"},{"type":"narration","text":"听到阿尔贝托的话，拉普兰德笑了一下。\n但是，她却垂下了手中的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在想，我是不是应该策划一场针对你的刺杀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对你来说，弑父难道是一件值得为之犹豫的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我犹豫的不是行为，而是意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意义？你居然也会探究所谓的意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我对意义的重视，如同你对利益的重视。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父亲，你知道我为什么那么关注德克萨斯吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你从来没有对我解释过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我自出生以来，就以这个家族一员的身份成长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以最标准的叙拉古人式教育来训练我，而我也回应了你的期待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在做一个叙拉古人这件事上，没有人做得比我更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为你从不承认自己的身份，乖女儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有哪一刻真的逃离了你的掌控吗，父亲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是你的掌控，是叙拉古，是家族，是血缘，是规则的掌控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我厌恶这一切，但我最终发现，我无法逃离它们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们在无形之中支配着我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论我怎样去反抗，到最后，我的反抗，也依然在你的掌控之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找不到出路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有你会认为，叙拉古是一座无法逃离的泥潭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而其他人，包括你，我的父亲，你们都是泥水，浑浊而不自知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，在那个年纪，我是想不通这些的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时的我以为自己足够疯狂，足够叛逆，但现在看来，那些都只不过是自欺欺人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在当时的你看来，再过几年，我一定就会接受现状了，对吧，父亲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毫无疑问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从你身上感到了叛逆，我却无法理解你的叛逆从何而来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你是如此地相信，你的生活、你的行为是正确的，父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你从未怀疑过，最终我会变成你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而就在这时，她出现了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一开始，是因为远在哥伦比亚，有一个做得比我更好的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜·德克萨斯，萨尔瓦多雷的孙女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷酷，强大，重情重义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"踏上叙拉古的土地后，她迅速成了家族之间最为出名的叙拉古人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使她只是一个哥伦比亚人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你与她不分伯仲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这不是重点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重点在于，她明明是一个叙拉古人，她明明完全沉醉于这座泥潭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，在最后，她选择了背弃自己的血缘，放任自己的家族被清算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应当被谴责的始终是朱塞佩，切利尼娜大义灭亲，何罪之有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"背叛在狼群之中并不少见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但她选择了背弃，她选择了逃离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能想象吗，父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那一天，当我发现，她居然想要离开叙拉古，抛弃这一切时，我是多么地——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兴奋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你难道认为这也是一种反抗，你认为她成功了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她没有成功，从一开始，我就知道，这片土地不会放过她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你为何又因她站在我的面前？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，父亲，不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会站在这里，并不是我从她的成功或者失败中学到了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而是她告诉我，原来还有这种选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道她最终会回到这片土地，我期待的，是她回来之后，会做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而她什么都没有做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你不会明白的，父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她做出了选择。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g1_srcstreet"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜，你以为你在做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不必知道，你也不会理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你曾经逃离了哥伦比亚，逃离了叙拉古，将这一切弃之不顾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，你又厚颜无耻地重新站在这片土地上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不觉得可笑吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这片土地还没有那么无可救药。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我不逃了，就这么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不逃了，所以你就回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些曾经被你丢下的人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你去对他们说啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在迁怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不得不对乔万娜下手，于是，你将原因归咎于我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还没有那么无耻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你也要为此付出代价。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......切利尼娜，你将不得好死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别担心，死亡是我最好的归宿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......恶......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"于是，现在，轮到我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾经苦思冥想，为此夜不能寐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，当我真的像这样站在你的面前时，我忽然意识到——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，这并不是一件多么困难的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来，我要做的不是反抗你，不是杀死你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要做的只是向你，向您，向我的父亲，向这个家族，向这座泥潭道别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"于是，我来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想成为整个叙拉古的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你错了，父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是叙拉古成了我的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"永别了，父亲。"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉普兰德向着自己的父亲深深地行了一个告别礼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i17"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿尔贝托隐隐约约感觉到，这是自己除掉这个怪物的最后机会。\n是的，怪物。\n由他亲手养大的怪物。\n她绝非无人能敌，却仿佛无法被任何事物击败。\n如果现在出手，他有十成的把握，将自己的女儿当场击杀。\n她绝非无所畏惧，但她主动抛弃了自己能够失去的一切。\n他理应出手，断绝后患。\n但是......\n“父亲”。\n这毕竟是他亲手养大的怪物。\n正如，若是单纯的解脱，她又何须来和自己见面？\n离群的狼终究会记得自己属于哪个族群，但今天之后，他的女儿，将不属于任何族群。\n阿尔贝托深深叹了口气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次见面，我会杀了你的，我的女儿，我的骄傲，我的叛徒。"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉普兰德笑了笑，没有回答。\n她不再是离群的狼。\n叙拉古再无她的容身之所。\n而她也不再需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的，只有你了，德克萨斯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让切利尼娜一个人去，真的没问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":true,"text":"放心吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":true,"text":"既然她要求一个人去，那就一定有她的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不好奇吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":true,"text":"你知道吗，作为一个好搭档的必要条件，就是不去问对方不想说的事情！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的关系可真好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":true,"text":"当然！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":true,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":true,"text":"有一个人正在往你那边去，他的速度很快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":true,"text":"对，就一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":true,"text":"黑发，穿得像一个很张扬的黑帮少爷，而且拿着两把铳形法杖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......莱昂？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅......果然是你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......莱昂图索，为什么你会在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在找你。但是，你把和家族有关的联络方式全都屏蔽了，我联络不上你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在寻找途中，从其他家族的人口中得知，有人封锁了次级核心区的各种通道，这不像是家族会做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才会来这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是了，你跟在卡拉奇身边那么久，你理应知道这里是最适合的突破口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我已经没有什么可跟你说的了，莱昂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，拉维妮娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是来——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱昂？！还有拉维妮娅，还有法庭的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，在背后操控次级核心区的人是你，拉维妮娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱昂，那场会谈之后，你究竟去了哪里？难道你一直和拉维妮娅在一起吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我去找了父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不告诉我？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......因为当我面对阿尔贝托时，当我听到那名洗车工对我的控诉时，我意识到——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去的我，错得离谱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"宽阔的大道上，德米特里与拉维妮娅各站一边。\n莱昂图索深吸了一口气，最终，走向了拉维妮娅那一边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是你的答案？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从现在起，我不再是贝洛内家族的领袖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你知道你在做什么，对吧，莱昂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论首领有什么崇高的理想，他都抛下了这个家族！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你呢，无论你又有怎样远大的目标，你也要抛下这个家族吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是一个家族啊，莱昂图索！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看着我的眼睛，回答我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们共同长大，共同经历了那么多的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对你来说，那些都不值一提吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父亲将整个家族当做火星，希望点燃叙拉古新时代的导火索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父亲确实错了，但是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莱昂图索缓缓抬起双眼，直视着德米特里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最终，我会站在所有家族的对立面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然它必将发生，那么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就让我们长痛不如短痛吧，德米特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"然而，就在千钧一发之际，一股寒意，忽然笼罩了在场的所有人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什......么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......脑海里......响起了声音......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色的雾气在场上凝结。\n随着雾气的凝聚，无形的威压一点一点地被加在了在场之人的头上，肩上，心中。\n他们从这股威压中感到了一丝亲近，仿佛那是与他们血脉相连的存在......不，那就是与他们血脉相连的存在。\n但下一刻，他们只感到无边的恐惧，因为这股威压中，蕴含着无边的怒火。\n理性在此时被压制，仿佛有一个声音在告诉他们——\n跪下。\n臣服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好冷......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"承受不住压力的人纷纷倒下，场上只余下莱昂图索、拉维妮娅、德米特里三人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得这种感觉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莱昂图索将视线投向黑色雾气凝结出的实体——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当心，那团黑色的雾气有问题！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......狼之主。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"话音未落，黑雾凝结而成的狼群，向着莱昂图索等人奔袭而来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
